<tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:hamavdil_bein_kodesh_lechol"><tei:pb n="552" ed="1949 shabbat/conclusion" facs="https://archive.org/download/PhilipBirnbaumHaSiddurHaShalemTheDailyPrayerBook1949/page/n576_medium.jpg"/><tei:p>Blessed art thou, Lord our God, King of the universe, who hast made a distinction between the sacred and the profane, between light and darkness, between Israel and the other nations, between the seventh day and the six working days. Blessed art thou, O Lord, who hast made a distinction between the sacred and the profane.</tei:p></tei:div>
